# Pomfret website — always publish

When you finish implementing or fixing anything under `website-code/` (unless the user explicitly says not to deploy):

1. Commit only the relevant `website-code/` files with a clear message.
2. `git push origin HEAD`
3. Deploy production from `website-code/`: `npm run deploy` (`vercel --prod --yes`)

Report the production URL (https://www.pomfretastro.org) and Vercel inspector link.

Do not wait for the user to say「发布」— treat deploy as part of the task completion for this app.

If Vercel CLI auth fails, retry after login; if Git push auto-deploy fails, still run CLI deploy.
